{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgr4JsK1tizNg4adNm5Ad","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The net plays odd first-line moves mid-game (e.g. (0,0), (4,0), (8,0)) because my convolved \"decidedness penalty\" treats off-board points as undecided, which favours edges. I'll replace it with a first-order territory-swing estimate: the output sums a \"contestedness\" bump relu(θ−|I|) over nearby points (built from three ReLUs of the influence), plus a penalty for playing inside own territory. Off-board points then contribute nothing, and the empty board naturally prefers the center.\n\n```python\nsrc=open('/work/build3.py').read()\nsrc=src.replace(\"def build3(cfg, inp):\",\"def build4(cfg, inp):\")\nsrc=src.replace(\"for nm in ['AtO','AtM','PEN','IP','IN']: F.add(nm)\",\"for nm in ['AtO','AtM','PEN','BA','BB','BC']: F.add(nm)\")\nsrc=src.replace(\"\"\"        up=F.u('IP',p); un=F.u('IN',p); s=0\n        for q in range(81):\n            k=kern.get(mdist(p,q),0)\n            if k: F.W[E.u('Z',q),up]+=k; F.W[E.u('Z',q),un]-=k; s+=k\n        F.b[up]=-2*s-th; F.b[un]=2*s-th\"\"\",\n\"\"\"        ua=F.u('BA',p); ub=F.u('BB',p); uc=F.u('BC',p); s=0\n        for q in range(81):\n            k=kern.get(mdist(p,q),0)\n            if k:\n                for uu in (ua,ub,uc): F.W[E.u('Z',q),uu]+=k\n                s+=k\n        F.b[ua]=-2*s+th; F.b[ub]=-2*s; F.b[uc]=-2*s-th\"\"\")\nsrc=src.replace(\"\"\"        for q in range(81):\n            dd=mdist(p,q)\n            if dd in ck:\n                O[F.u('IP',q),p]-=sp*ck[dd]*cfg['own_scale']\n                O[F.u('IN',q),p]-=sp*ck[dd]*cfg['opp_scale']\"\"\",\n\"\"\"        for q in range(81):\n            dd=mdist(p,q)\n            if dd in ck:\n                w=sp*cfg['alpha']*ck[dd]\n                O[F.u('BA',q),p]+=w; O[F.u('BB',q),p]-=2*w; O[F.u('BC',q),p]+=w\n        O[F.u('BC',p),p]-=sp*cfg['beta_own']\"\"\")\nopen('/work/build4.py','w').write(src)\nexec(open('/work/build4.py').read())\nimport json\ncfg=json.load(open('/work/cfg_v6.json'))\ncfg.update(theta=1.5, conv={0:1.0,1:1.0,2:0.5,3:0.25}, alpha=0.5, beta_own=2.0, spos=2.0)\narrs,layout=build4(cfg,inp)\nfor k,v in arrs.items(): save(k,v)\njson.dump(cfg,open('/work/cfg_v7.json','w')); json.dump(layout,open('/work/layout_v7.json','w'))\nprint(layout[5]); print(cfg)\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10182,"cache_read_input_tokens":309661,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10182},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7058487b-e813-4267-8caf-88948278edbe","uuid":"57dc169f-cbf6-456a-9449-acd51c621a0a","timestamp":"2026-11-08T20:03:13.072Z","request_id":"req_011Cgr4Js4e1BRxFt6pFVHdz"}
